{"strongs": "H5356", "word": "נִקָּיוֺן", "translit": "niq.qa.von", "root": "נקד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "innocency", "definition": "נִקָּיוֺן noun [masculine] innocency ; — ׳ נ Ps 26:6 ; Ps 73:13 נִקָּיֹן Hos 8:5 construct נִקְּיוֺן Amos 4:6 נִקְיֹן Gen 20:5 — 1. freedom from guilt, innocency: כַּפַּי ׳ נ Gen 20:5 ( R JE ); דַּפָּ֑י ׳ אֶרְחַץ בנ Ps 26:6 I will wash my hands in innocency = Ps 73:13 . 2. freedom from punishment Hos 8:5 . 3. in physical sense, נִקְיוֺם שִׁנַּיִם cleanness of teeth (without food) Amos 4:6 (but read perhaps after ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ7 קַהֲיוֺן bluntness , so Lag BN 201 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5367')\">BDB5367</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5356')\">H5356</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5366')\">BDB5366</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5368')\">BDB5368</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נִקָּיוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>innocency</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 26:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,6)\">Ps 26:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,13)\">Ps 73:13</ref> <bdbheb>נִקָּיֹן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,5)\">Hos 8:5</ref> construct <bdbheb>נִקְּיוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 4:6\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,6)\">Amos 4:6</ref> <bdbheb>נִקְיֹן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,5)\">Gen 20:5</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>freedom from guilt, innocency:</highlight> <bdbheb>כַּפַּי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 20:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,5)\">Gen 20:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink><sup><reflink>JE</reflink></sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>דַּפָּ֑י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶרְחַץ בנ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 26:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,6)\">Ps 26:6</ref> <highlight>I will wash my hands in innocency</highlight> = <ref ref=\"Ps 73:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,13)\">Ps 73:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>freedom from punishment</highlight> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:5\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,5)\">Hos 8:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in physical sense, <bdbheb>נִקְיוֺם שִׁנַּיִם</bdbheb> <highlight>cleanness of teeth</highlight> (without food) <ref ref=\"Amos 4:6\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,6)\">Amos 4:6</ref> (but read perhaps after <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>קַהֲיוֺן</bdbheb> <highlight>bluntness</highlight>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 201</sup></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 26:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 26, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ps 73:13", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 73, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Hos 8:5", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 8, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Amos 4:6", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 20:5", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 20, "verse": 5}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["נִקָּיוֺן", "׳", "נ", "נִקָּיֹן", "נִקְּיוֺן", "נִקְיֹן", "כַּפַּי", "דַּפָּ֑י", "אֶרְחַץ בנ", "נִקְיוֺם שִׁנַּיִם", "ᵐ5", "ᵑ6", "ᵑ7", "קַהֲיוֺן"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Lag", "R", "Sept", "Syr", "Tg"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB5367", "source": "B